Package: swaybg
Version: @DEB_SWAYBG_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: X11/Wayland Apps
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/swaywm/swaybg
Depends: libwayland0, libcairo2
Description: Wallpaper tool for Wayland compositors
 swaybg is a small wallpaper utility for wlroots-compatible Wayland
 compositors. It maps a background layer-shell surface and draws image buffers
 with cairo. This iOS build disables gdk-pixbuf to keep the dependency surface
 small.
